    "title": "MICROSERVICE-PROD-Replace Employee Access *-spec",
    "description": "This API allows for seamless management of employee access within the human resources framework of the banking system. It facilitates the modification of access permissions for individual employees, ensuring that roles and responsibilities align with organizational requirements. Designed primarily for HR personnel and system administrators, the API enables efficient updates to access levels as employees' roles change. Use cases include granting new permissions, updating existing access rights, and revoking obsolete permissions to enhance security and compliance.",
